From 63e5d894150a5d5d1d897a639199a096815bb385 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Project <noreply@invalid>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 09:29:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: classify static MT6797 late-CPU capabilities

Add the blocked expected-A72 40-row static census while
preserving six evidence-dependent rows and every admission/commit veto.

This experiment-only change has no certifying sign-off and is not
submission-ready.
